Cloaks are important (especially when wearing dragon scale) because of
a mysterious unreported (within the game) property named Magic
Cancellation that helps against things like werewolf bites, level
drain attacks, green slimes and lots more.  Oilskin, protection, CoMR,
robe and elven cloak all the highest MC, so you'd do well to wear one
of those.

