There is an upstairs in the Valley of the Dead that will put you into
the maze on the right side of the lowest Dungeons of Doom level, the
castle.  So long as you haven't filled the pits in the castle with
boulders it's easy enough to come and go between the dungeons and
gehennom.

You'll want the wand of wishing from the castle if you haven't got it
yet, although navigating the castle liches without MR is very risky,
so either genocide L, or find another way of getting MR (you might be
able to kill a gray dragon and get gray scales, and wear those
temporarily while using the shield of reflection until you get to the
wand, for example).  Other than that I don't see a reason to go back
up.

